            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in v1.04</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Diagnostic Reports</b> — Send anonymous system &amp; display info to help us troubleshoot issues faster.</li>
                    <li><b>Graphic App Profile</b> — Added touch profile for Graphic (formerly iDraw) with pinch-to-zoom support.</li>
                    <li><b>Magnifier Improvements</b> — Better performance and stability for the on-screen magnifier.</li>
                </ul>
